 /*********************************************************************/
 /* Program     : COCRDUPC.PLI                                        */
 /* Application : CardDemo                                            */
 /* Type        : IMS PL/I Program                                    */
 /* Function    : Credit Card Update                                  */
 /* Converted from COBOL/CICS: app/cbl/COCRDUPC.cbl                  */
